    2.5  Edit (Gadget)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Select a node, then select this gadget to edit the account of the user
    online.


    2.6  Msg (Gadget)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Select a node, then select this gadget to send a msg to the user online.


    2.7  Panic (Gadget)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    If your server locks up after trying to send a command to a locked node,
    then use this gadget to free up the server again to work with other nodes
    which are not locked.


    2.8  MsgA (Gadget)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    This gadget sends an online message to all users currently logged on the
    bbs and not just a single user.


    2.9  Time (Gadget)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Select a node, then select this gadget to edit a user's time limit,
    time left, chat time limit, chat time left, and  user's bypass idle
    time.

    Values can be modified by either clicking the text gadget and entering
    the value or by adjusting the scroll bars to the right.

    If you select the close window gadget or the cancel gadget the values
    will not be set, only be clicking the Set Time gadget will the changes
    take effect.


