 3.0  Vanilla Keys (HotKeys)
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
 These are the vanilla keys that can be typed on the server window to do
 the same functions as gadgets with the Underscore letters.


    Supported Keys & Functions:
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    A...Abort Transfer
    C...Chat User
    D...Dump (Hangup User)
    E...Edit User Online
    I...Iconify Node Toggle
    L...Local Logon
    M...Msg (Send Online Message to User)
    N...iNfo (Info of user online)
    S...Sysop Logon
    T...Time (Adjust User Time)

