    4.1  BBS Config
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Load BBS Config Program.


    4.2  Account Editor
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Load External Account Editor.


    4.3  About TServer
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Info about TServer.


    4.4  Quit Tserver
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Shutdown TServer.


    4.5  Workbench Screen (Toggle)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    This toggles the Server between the Workbench screen or custom screen,
    defined with Screen Mode.


    4.6  Compact Server (Toggle)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    This toggles between full gadget display or a compact mode.


    4.7  Screen To Front (Toggle)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    This is whether or not the server screen comes to the front when a
    node is iconified.


    4.8  Confirm (Toggle)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    This is whether or not a yes/no requester comes up to confirm an
    operation.

    NOTE: A yes/no requester will come up no matter what this setting is
          when you try to shut down the server.


    4.9  Double Click (Toggle)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    This is whether or not a node will un-iconify/iconify when you double
    click on the node.


    4.10  Chat Requests (Toggle)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    When this is selected and a user pages the sysop, a window will open up
    on the sysop's current screen.  This window will have the display of the
    user's handle, reason for chat, sysop comment on user, and several gadgets
    for selecting.  These gadets are:

    .-------------------------------------------.
    |--| Chat Request Window                 |--|
    |-------------------------------------------|
    |    User: The Skeleton                     |
    |  Reason: I need to talk to you            |
    | Comment: Programmer of Tempest            |
    |----------.----------.----------.----------|
    |  Ignore  |  Accept  |   Chat   | Send Msg |
    |----------|----------|----------|----------|
    |  Watch   |          |          |   Drop   |
    |----------^----------^----------^----------|
    | .---------------------------------------. |
    | | Send OLM to user in this box          | |
    | `---------------------------------------' |
    `-------------------------------------------'

    (Ignore)   - Does nothing and ignores the chat request.

    (Accept)   - Displays a message to the user that the sysop knows they
                 paged and will enter chat if they wish.

    (Chat)     - Enter chat with the user immediately.

    (Send Msg) - Send message, entered in the text gadget box of this window,
                 to the user.

    (Watch)    - Watch the user.  The node un-iconifies and comes to front so
                 the sysop can watch the user.

    (Dump!)    - Dump User.  Kicks the user off the bbs completely.


