    4.13  Title Bar Clock
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Active: Turns Date/Time titlebar clock on/off.

    Military: Toggles between military time (24 hour) and am/pm time display.


    4.14  Screen Mode
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    This is where you define the screen mode for the server to use when it is
    on its own custom screen.


    4.15  Font
    ~~~~~~~~~~
    This is where you define the font to be used by the Server.
    Fonts defined while server is on workbench screen and custom screen will
    be saved seperately.  So to have different font configurations when using
    workbench screen and custom screen, save prefs on each screen after
    selecting font.

    - Window positions of the server will also be saved seperately for each
      screen.


